Baʼii barreessi: ['Test object'], dhaabi.
>> l := Tarree-wantootaa haaraa ; 1 ; ( Tarree-wantootaa haaraa ; (Yeroo haaraa: 1) ; (Int64 barreeffama-irraa: ['321']) ; (Tarree-wantootaa haaraa ; 3)).
Baʼii barreessi: l, dhaabi.
>> old-lst-address := l fakkeenya-jalqabaa teessoo-memoorii.
l save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
Baʼii barreessi: ['========== RELOADING SNAP:'], dhaabi.
>> b := Wanta load-from: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
(b fakkeenya-jalqabaa teessoo-memoorii = old-lst-address) yoodhugaa: {
	Baʼii barreessi: ['Object link re-attached.'], dhaabi.
}.
Baʼii barreessi: b, dhaabi.
